    "4": {
      "uid": 4,
      "key": [
        "Sabzeruz Festival",
        "Nilou",
        "Dance of Sabzeruz",
        "Zubayr Theater"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Azar",
        "Grand Sage"
      ],
      "comment": "Azar: Nilou and the Sabzeruz Festival",
      "content": "Azar came in person while his entourage Setaria told Nilou that the law reserves large religious festivals for the Akademiya. He called dance and art frivolous in a land of knowledge and reason and ordered the stage torn down, then had the Scribe instructed to draft an ordinance banning public art performances before the next Jnagarbha Day. In a dream scene the Traveler later sees puppet versions of Azar and Setaria vanish when Nilou imagines them away.",
