      "key": [
        "Setaria"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Azar",
        "Grand Sage",
        "entourage"
      ],
      "comment": "Azar: Setaria",
      "content": "Setaria, a desert-born scholar, served Azar and carried out his bans, but felt guilty about the neglect of her homeland. After Nahida and the Traveler talked to her she decided to leave the Akademiya and return to the desert, only to find that Azar had gone.",
