      "key": [
        "Naphis",
        "Baladhuri",
        "Amurta",
        "Vahumana"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Azar",
        "Grand Sage",
        "sage"
      ],
      "comment": "Azar: Naphis and Baladhuri",
      "content": "The sages of Amurta and Vahumana opposed the god-making plan, and the other four sages imprisoned them. Naphis has a legendary temper, to the point that Azar gave him leeway. After Azar's fall both were released; the four Darshans that backed Azar had their sages replaced.",
